      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "女主角因为某些缘故和家人失散，\n为了独自生存，\n女扮男装前去侍奉一位公爵――",
      "source_fingerprint": "756fdbdd378cda11e079f46a38e4989d2c835d8c89bdfde8f33338832ce90ab6",
