    {
      "uid": "zhcn:436a21562304eaf3732eab50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她那英姿飒爽而又高洁的模样。\n与接受媒体采访，\n历代后冠赛马娘们的身姿重叠在一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffdf0d9df02e676f1ce0cf1a8aa61ff1bbe6fb46dfaf7b08d05af63d4834945a",
