    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1954fc1294f92c139102593",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们在赢得后冠前一定经历了重重苦难。\n却丝毫不曾显露，\n只展现出正面迎战的意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bed805bdb335455009f550714a405e3cbe793cbe3c4abc398aeaee956661925",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
