    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dec9d19c91c9257b7550457",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "因此，我才想把女主角身穿的男装，\n融入胜负服的设计。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b13a0c6f1d00846e411b7957816fd08c4b8925cdf1b247c20d0ad07c8bbc1ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        19,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/19/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cfd1c8c7e87aad0ae13e8a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身穿这套服装的你，完全是“ON”状态呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "a724ebb938916eb8523f4ede71f5f20a0636419ec9222973e84b5f1f7391ba35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ab5ae694eae80eaa43aa19b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身穿这套服装的您，完全是“ON”状态呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e33708a9de561677a7ed5a152cbdb3f45cc9089bd2f4a29b44534b9930aba90",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1252430318ffaa574ddb0af3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥以比平时\n更加坚毅的神情回答。\n那股气势甚至压倒了提问的我――",
      "source_fingerprint": "946830dae23d20ef002dbea2000f961a61740187a8bd8a8d03119be46f435a49",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b413734a5f6871becf1f8736",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莫非，你说的那出喜剧就是这个？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af8376f28be6db5a23638ccb2db520ce3bd260631ebfd3afecdfd5068748e8b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502e7e01a4f227d27e5c5529",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "难怪穿上胜负服的西沙里奥，\n会彻底进入状态。心中了然的同时，\n我也想起了刚才便一直在意的事……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d377eaec56dce645c27e4b09bb9a007cd7ff4f2ae7a633a9c3206846a3040a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:854de7901dd77c8eddd51381",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我从书架上，摆放兴趣书籍的那一层\n取出一本剧本。看到书名的瞬间，\n西沙里奥的脸一下子亮了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a8af7c5c64cbd7174b46e1ddb1f2416efff0a4a5d40b89da283bb321272e541",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b82ca689cf3f8f65cf5bc21d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。这也是我爱读的书之一",
      "source_fingerprint": "eadc4c38b89b2860595ef6923a4def97980f516e9fa2f8ee0b738eceae8eada9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
