        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29cb9332bf785f422aafb041",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是的。我会凭借配得上这身胜负服的实力，\n展现出身为『基石』应有的器量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ced5682951ddba1bd3fc21e28919eef787a5ebebbb41390b04c46521035fdc00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70a58d65acdb867cfd5ebf13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥做出强而有力的宣言，\n浑身充满着仿佛足以压倒整座舞台的\n威严。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06ca04ec5985fac8eb48e5b692c8e4246fca7abcdace6a03bfe17669e07a35f2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3355b03d5efe35de62479aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我必须把这份光辉，升华为\n引导未来赛马娘们的路标――\n感受着胸中的悸动，我坚定地立下决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f1afe63f6cda1db0f03c1a48d3648ed50b73199c63a3414308266bd03741b9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecf142cc5a23c90d082a63ad",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "战斗者，这个词再贴切不过。\n仿佛无论怎样的苦难都能跨越――\n如今的西沙里奥，拥有这样的气魄。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67feb9d217711ca979083e57496d0eabde9cfa97e76d1968c169d34b254128b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb47ca56396a3c742f80c61e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b7ea8f429e376dcab41bee5b946ee4fb9dc8e928a406a356926b617ad6aaffb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:284fb3d74de814bd75e0e52d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我已谨记于心。\n伟业正是由点滴积累成就。\n我会刻下与这身胜负服相称的蹄迹。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f34fa0584a2960b908bacc0c40b83e8893a5bd9657a5358366c6a4796cf96d9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a1743c714cab736d5e8f1d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强而有力地做出宣言的西沙里奥，\n英姿足以令所有见到她的人\n无一不为之倾倒。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5b6f8d2a8f9aed4b1256af653d58452306e306f6296526b94b69ebb546b2d24",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b555bec1832ba0077f9aac9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我必须把收获的赞誉，升华为\n供未来赛马娘们前行的坚实道路――\n感受着责任之重，我坚定地立下决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1155127538f2ec6dfdbc3297aac40e6e9e53ccd1f5ebc402f6785977b3083fe0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5cbbd9340aea6cdcebb5db7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "或许是因为胜负服中寄托的心意吧。\n我第一次隐约察觉到那份心意，\n是在提交胜负服设计前不久――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d58dfb49bf5fa2f11a96dcfc5297f4bb846bea6e54cb5016fe414b032c7f434",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8584b880d47ce720bbb6814e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊。似乎是出了差错才通知得晚",
      "source_fingerprint": "19d19c436f7854280b9a96b465356dcb2eb4f8297fc8126ea3875af555a2d9e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1110/storytimeline_501110513.json",
