    {
      "uid": "zhcn:753744ea1e72a9380238ab67",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥拿出来的，\n是一幅显然出自年幼孩童之手的稚拙图画。\n不过设计本身没有问题便就此提交――",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbadc4686e4db7437a28878bc31fc1fb534270ab505a63fa34fa44090f4a18d4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
